      "review_title": "",
      "review_description": "The quoting process was very helpful, the salesman knew his products and listened to what my wife and i were looking for and gave us a quote for the correct system, He was always ready to answer any Questions or ease any uncertainty we had.The Customer service and Administration team were up to date with everything in regards to organizing dates and times for the Installation of our system, they kept us in the loop in regards to what to expect  in regards to paperwork from our energy supplier to the final paperwork when the system went online.The installation crew that turned up were polite and quite knowledgeable about the product they were fitting, the workmanship is quite neat and tidy, they explained to us what the system was capable of and what to expect from it. There are still a few bugs to work out in regards to getting generator backup plug working correctly again but the technician is working hard to rectify the problem.",
